      "index": 0,
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 4.72,
      "source_text": "La \u00fanica puerta que se cierra y nunca se vuelve a abrir es la de la ta\u00fad.",
      "translated_text": "The only door that closes and never reopens is the one in the ta\u00fad.",
      "original_duration": 4.72,
